    "instructions": "1. Combine sugar and lemon juice in a cocktail shaker.\n2. Stir until the sugar dissolves.\n3. Add the remaining ingredients to the shaker.\n4. Add ice and shake until chilled.\n5. Double strain into a chilled cocktail glass.\n6. Garnish with a lemon twist, a lime twist, and skewered cherries.",
